                  "text": "Plan mode has ended. You are no longer in read-only mode. User confirmed plan. You MUST now proceed with implementation.\n\nPlan saved to `/fixture/workspace/advanced/.cortex/plans/plan_2026-11-03_0356.md`.\nThe confirmed plan is available in this conversation history. Reference it as you execute each step.\n\nCRITICAL REQUIREMENTS for plan execution:\n\nPHASE 0 \u2014 Create a task for this plan:\n  1. Read the confirmed plan in this conversation\n  2. For each task needed to implement this plan, create it with: `cortex ctx task add \"<task name>\" --plan /fixture/workspace/advanced/.cortex/plans/plan_2026-11-03_0356.md`\n  3. The --plan flag links the task to this specific plan. Only use it for tasks that implement this plan.\n\nPHASE 1 \u2014 Create executable steps:\n  1. Create concrete ctx steps from that plan using `cortex ctx step add \"<step>\" -t <task_id>`\n  2. If needed, add dependencies using `cortex ctx step block <step_id> <blocker_id> -t <task_id>`\n\nPHASE 2 \u2014 Execute ready steps:\n  1. Run `cortex ctx step ready -t <task_id>` to get steps with no blockers\n  2. For each ready step, either execute directly or launch subagents in parallel\n  3. As each step completes, run `cortex ctx step done <step_id> -t <task_id>` immediately\n  4. Repeat until no steps remain\n\nPHASE 3 \u2014 Complete the task:\n  After all steps complete, run `cortex ctx task done <task_id>`"
                }
